# Optional — connects the website's forms to Supabase so submissions
# reach the admin app + email. If left blank, the site still works
# (Enquiry form falls back to WhatsApp; lucky draw saves locally).
#
# Copy this to `.env.local` and fill in from Supabase → Settings → API.
# `.env.local` is gitignored — never commit real keys.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
